<Layout title="">
    <img src="/o7.png" alt="The o7 Jazz Ensemble logo" width="600px"/>
	<h1>Welcome to The Phoneys!</h1>
	<p> Hello! We are the o7 Jazz Ensemble, a small jazz band focusing on the wonderful music from video games! 
        For reasons probably too complicated to explain, we also often refer to ourselves as the Phoneys</p>

	<h2>Meet the Band!</h2>
	<h3>Horns</h3>
	<span>
        Flute<br>
        Alto/Tenor Saxophone<br>
        Trumpet<br>
	</span>
	<h3>Rhythm</h3>
	<p>
		Piano<br>
        Double Bass<br>
        Drums<br>
        Auxillary Percussion<br>
        Rhythm Guitar<br>
        Lead Guitar,<br>
        Cello
    </p>
</Layout>